stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initialized: new()

    Initialized --> Running: adopt(job_name)
    Initialized --> Running: start() [Success]
    Initialized --> Finished: start() [Failed]
    Initialized --> [*]: clean_up(job_name)

    Running --> Succeeded: wait() [JobState::Succeeded]
    Running --> Failed: wait() [JobState::Failed]

    Finished --> [*]: into_result()
    Succeeded --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
